}

{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Min-Heap implementation using a dynamic array (std::vector).\par
Array-based implementation of a complete binary tree. The parent node always has a smaller calorie value than its child nodes.\par
Maintains the heap property based on {\field {\*\fldinst { HYPERLINK  \\l "AAAAAAAABP" }{}}{\fldrslt {\cs37\ul\cf2 Recipe}}} calorie values. \par
}}
